  "body_text_excerpt": "Search COLORS PRODUCTS INSPIRATION VISUALIZER FIND A STORE BOOK A PAINTER ABOUT CHROMA 2K TOPCOAT MATT Solvent Based Ask about product PRODUCT DESCRIPTION Chroma 2K Topcoat Matt is a two-component system based on hydroxyl functional acrylic resin, designed to deliver a superior, long-lasting, Matt finish for automotive refinishing. RECOMMENDED USE This product is recommended to be applied over 1K and 2K Chroma Primer, old/original paintwork, and all existing OEM finishes. Used for Automotive applications. Key Information Finish Matt Spreading Rate 15 - 16 m²/L Dry Time -Touch dry: 45-60 mins -",
